WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.602
-All right, welcome back!
Today is Friday,

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.804
and that's usually when I catch
up on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.906
You know, I check my inbox,
I return some e-mails,

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.808
and, of course,
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:11.811
And I was running a bit behind.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.179
I thought,
if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.014
I'd like to write out a few
thank-you notes right now.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:18.083
Is that okay with you guys?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:20.353
Can I get some thank-you-note-
writing music, please?

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.955 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.689
Oh. Beautiful.
-Classic.

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:25.091
-Here we go. [ Clears throat ]

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:29.662 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.564
Thank you, Peeps,

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:35.835
for being an edible
Mr. Clean Magic Eraser.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:42.642
-[ Imitating squeaking rubber ]

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:45.278
[ Gags ]

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.346
Pbht!

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.647
-Actually, I was gonna
blow a bubble.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.282
-Oh. [ Lips pop ]

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.885 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:55.955
-Thank you,
President Trump and court,

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.791
for probably thinking,
"What would Gwyneth do?"

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:04.463
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.999
-I wish you well.

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:08.434 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:11.871
-Thank you, green Masters
jackets, for making winners

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.673
of the world's
most famous golf tournament

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:17.911
look like they're
assistant managers at Subway.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:22.115
Is your -- Is your artist
taking care of you?

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:23.783
-[ Chuckles ] Sandwich artists.
-Is your artist

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:26.752
taking care of you?
Yeah.

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:29.221
You work at Subway?

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:30.924
-No, I eat at Subway.

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:34.294 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:37.096
-Thank you, canoes,
for being a great way

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.564
to travel on the water,

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:40.566
unless you have to shift
your weight one centimeter

00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:42.435
to the side, then...

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.436
-Oh, oh, hey.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.072
[ Applause ]

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:48.074
-[ Imitates splashing water ]

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.343 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:53.746
Thank you, vision boards,

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.782
for looking like
I'm either a serial killer

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.251
or trying to stop
a serial killer.

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:03.656
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.458
-He's inside the house.
-He's in the house.

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:08.594
[ Audience chuckles ]

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:10.029 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:13.399
-Thank you, candied nuts,
for letting me

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.368
get catfished by an almond.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:23.376
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:27.614 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.915
Thank you,
trying to find the remote,

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:32.551
for being the adult version
of an Easter egg hunt.

00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:33.719
There you have it, everybody.

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:34.954
Those are our thank-you notes.

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:38.357
We'll be right back
with the Jonas Brothers!

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:40.593
-♪ Yeah! ♪

